OL,3,GNEWSAResidents came to harm at
OL,4,Ainadequate home - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home where residents came "to
OL,7,Factual harm" has been placed in special
OL,8,Fmeasures after inspectors found a
OL,9,F"significant decline" in the care being
OL,10,Foffered.
OL,12,FThe Red House Welfare and Housing
OL,13,FSociety, in Sudbury, Suffolk, has been
OL,14,Frated inadequate by the Care Quality
OL,15,FCommission (CQC) after an inspection in
OL,16,FJune.
OL,18,FInspectors said medicines were not
OL,19,Fstored securely, hazardous substances
OL,20,Fwere accessible and hot water pipes
OL,21,Fwere uncovered.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
